  "prefLabel": "Env-A 909.02 Frequency of Reporting; Information Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 909.02 Frequency of Reporting; Information Required. The owner or operator of the stationary source, area source, or device shall submit all information required by Env-A 905 as applicable to the source or device covered by the report by April 15 of the year following the calendar year covered by the report.\n\nSource. #6983-B, eff 4-23-99 (formerly Env-A 901.09); ss by #8872, eff 4-21-07; ss by #10892, eff 7-18-15; ss by #14374, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
